}

params:path {
  idOrSlug: build-responsive-nestjs-and-react-applications-20260624012429
}

docs {
  ### Get Gig
  Public endpoint to retrieve details of a single gig by its UUID or unique slug.
  
  > [!IMPORTANT]
  > Details are only returned if the gig status is `active`. If draft, paused, or archived, a `400 Bad Request` is returned.
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "seller": "uuid-string",
      "title": "Build NestJS Backend",
      "slug": "build-nestjs-backend-20260624003000",
      "status": "active",
      "views": 4,
      "seller": {
        "id": "uuid-string",
        "name": "Jane Doe",
        "username": "janedoe",
        "email": "jane@example.com",
        "avatar": "https://cdn.gighub.ahsanull.com/avatars/jane.png"
      },
      "category": {
        "id": "uuid-string",
        "name": "Web Development",
        "slug": "web-dev"
      }
    },
    "message": "Gig retrieved successfully"
  }
  ```
}
